repository-code: https://github.com/CIAT-Artemis/imagesafari-artemis-crop-images
url: https://github.com/CIAT-Artemis/imagesafari-artemis-crop-images
abstract: >
  A unified agricultural image dataset comprising 7,469,218 field photographs
  across two complementary datasets. Artemis (1,387,663 images) is a
  structured phenotyping collection across four crops and four countries;
  published Artemis annotations cover three crops (soybean has imagery only).
  Image Safari (6,081,555 images) is a diversity-driven corpus across 18 crops
  and nine countries. A subset of 46,952 images includes organ-level
  annotations.
keywords:
  - agriculture
  - computer vision
  - crop images
  - machine learning
  - phenotyping
